# google-ima.js – stub for the Google IMA SDK

This file is a stub that replaces `https://imasdk.googleapis.com/js/sdkloader/ima3.js`
so that the real Google Interactive Media Ads SDK is never loaded.

## Source

Based on uBlock Origin's `google-ima.js` resource:
  https://github.com/gorhill/uBlock/blob/master/src/web_accessible_resources/google-ima.js

Copyright Raymond Hill and uBlock Origin contributors.

